      <activity id="33dc6e04-5f12-5c6f-baa9-8336ae02f5c8" activityNameId="21c763c3-88fa-513d-ab12-66413f011813" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Electricity, medium voltage, production CENTREL, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Electricity, medium voltage, production CENTREL, at grid
This dataset describes the transformation from high to medium voltage as well as the transmission of electricity at medium voltage.;
UUID: 834f917e-b8dd-30e6-9ccd-7325bafa351a
Included are the electricity production using , the transmission network and direct SF6-emissions to air. Electricity losses during medium-voltage transmission and transformation from high-voltage are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA. Assumptions for transmission network, losses and emissions are based on Swiss data.
Technology: Average technology used to transmit and distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines, as well as air-, vacuum- and SF6-insulated high-to-medium voltage switching stations. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Statistics for 2008
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_834f917e-b8dd-30e6-9ccd-7325bafa351a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
